{"query_id": "ordinary-backup-retention", "answer": "Based on the provided documents, an everyday product workspace falls under the standard workspace backup policy, which excludes finance ledgers and design source archives [1]. Daily recovery points for these workspaces are retained for 30 days [1]. Additionally, deleted workspace items remain recoverable for 30 days before being purged from active systems [2]. Therefore, you can recover an everyday product workspace snapshot for **30 days**.\n\n[1], [2]", "ranked_ids": ["backup-standard", "privacy-retention-current", "backup-design", "backup-finance", "privacy-deletion-request"], "citation_map": {"1": "backup-standard", "2": "privacy-retention-current", "3": "backup-design", "4": "backup-finance", "5": "privacy-deletion-request"}, "cited_ids": [1, 2], "cited_document_ids": ["backup-standard", "privacy-retention-current"], "invalid_citations": [], "required_fact_groups_matched": 1, "total_required_fact_groups": 2, "forbidden_pattern_hits": [], "facts_correct": false, "citations_correct": false, "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "answer_correct": false, "latency_ms": 3708.8491250033258, "model": "Qwen3.8-27B-Q5_K_S.gguf"}
