{"query_id": "aurora-release-blocker", "answer": "Based on the provided documents, the accessibility problems that would prevent Aurora from shipping (blocking the release) are:\n\n1.  Critical keyboard-navigation issues [1].\n2.  Critical keyboard or screen-reader failures [5].\n3.  Critical automated audit findings [5].\n4.  Lack of keyboard access to every interactive control [5].\n5.  Lack of visible focus [5].\n6.  Lack of screen-reader names for controls [5].\n\nThe launch readiness specifically depends on completing the accessibility audit and resolving every critical keyboard-navigation issue [1]. While medium visual or color-contrast defects do not block the release, they require a documented exception signed by product and design [1], [5].", "ranked_ids": ["project-aurora-current", "project-aurora-archive", "travel-medical-exception", "aurora-astronomy", "accessibility-release-gate"], "citation_map": {"1": "project-aurora-current", "2": "project-aurora-archive", "3": "travel-medical-exception", "4": "aurora-astronomy", "5": "accessibility-release-gate"}, "cited_ids": [1, 5], "cited_document_ids": ["project-aurora-current", "accessibility-release-gate"], "invalid_citations": [], "required_fact_groups_matched": 4, "total_required_fact_groups": 4, "forbidden_pattern_hits": [], "facts_correct": true, "citations_correct": true, "abstained": false, "expected_abstain": false, "answer_correct": true, "latency_ms": 4804.048083009548, "model": "Qwen3.8-27B-Q5_K_S.gguf"}
